\n\n- **Legs 2 and 5 are not in your request.** rh1 and arb1 both hold 0 ETH, and each L2 swap needs 0.00002 ETH of gas. arb1 will also end up holding USDC, so it has to keep gas for one more transaction. The 0.00025 ETH per bridge covers the $0.50 bridge fee, the swap gas and that reserve.\n- **I priced the other way to reach USDC on arb1.** Swapping WBTC to USDC on Ethereum and then bridging the USDC costs $5.30. Bridging WBTC and swapping on arb1 costs $1.76, so I used the second.\n- **The split depends on leg 1's real output.** I'll read eth1's WBTC balance after leg 1 and halve that. If it isn't 495,000, I'll re-quote legs 3 to 7.\n- **Quotes may expire mid-route.** They last 300 s and the route takes about 5 minutes, so I may have to re-quote some. The approved max cost equals the current total, so a re-quote that costs more will halt the route for your decision.\n- **Execution is one leg at a time.** I'll confirm each leg and check its destination balance before the next."}]},{"role":"user","sequence":25,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":26,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_12"},"id":"toolu_01Ybgcc8TCV5QKVqyJ8rpi2s"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":27,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_13\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01Ybgcc8TCV5QKVqyJ8rpi2s","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":28,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_13"},"id":"toolu_01Qc2aVy6MhkZhGR7fg5Uq7N"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":29,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01Qc2aVy6MhkZhGR7fg5Uq7N","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":30,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_g