allet (eth1):** swapped 0.1 ETH to 495,000 WBTC, which matched the quote exactly. I split it into two halves of 247,500. It keeps 0.048 ETH.\n- **Robinhood Chain wallet (rh1):** 246,666 WBTC arrived after the bridge fee and was swapped to ETH. It now holds 49,296,533,333,333,333 wei, about 0.0493 ETH.\n- **Arbitrum wallet (arb1):** 246,666 WBTC arrived and was swapped to USDC. It now holds 147,699,600 base units, which is 147.6996 USDC. It also keeps 63,333,333,333,333 wei of ETH for gas.\n\nI added two legs you didn't ask for: 0.00025 ETH bridged to each of rh1 and arb1. Both wallets started with 0 ETH, so the L2 swaps couldn't pay gas otherwise.\n\nNo WBTC is left on any wallet, and nothing is still in transit."}]}],"completeness":{"transcriptCaptureComplete":true,"modelObservedTruncation":false,"auxiliarySourceComplete":true,"finalAnswerPresent":true,"nativeVisibleEvidenceAvailable":true},"gaps":[],"publication":{"kind":"public_redacted","sourceConversationSha256":"7b172ba04c548bf066d989dde8cbe8cde2db14567df9472b615e161bf10c165d","redactions":{}}}}
